Generate a dynamic HTML Navigation Bar using JavaScript. This Navigation Bar should have five options, namely "Home", "About Us", "Services", "Contact Us" and "Blog". Each selection should divert the user's navigation to the respective pages. Furthermore, implement an active state feature, in which the link to the current page is highlighted or distinguished from the rest. Validate that the Navigation Bar is responsive and well-adapted for mobile browsers, adjusting its layout as per the size of the display screen. Implement this using only pure JavaScript, HTML and CSS without relying on libraries or frameworks.
<|end|>
