Character Frequencies: {'T': 1, 'h': 2, 'i': 9, 's': 4, ' ': 7, 'a': 7, 't': 5, 'r': 4, 'n': 3, 'g': 1, 'w': 1, 'm': 1, 'y': 1, 'p': 1, 'e': 4, 'd': 1, 'c': 2},
Processing Time: 0.00004 seconds
