ent? Could you also shed light on the potential effects of quantum entanglement on the extensive realm of quantum mechanics, and how it might guide the future course of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement? Could you also assess the potential outcomes of quantum entanglement on the wide range of quantum mechanics, and how it might mold the future of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement?
