Construct a supervised learning algorithm to forecast the likelihood of an individual developing a specific category of carcinoma, such as lung or breast cancer. The features to be used in the predictive model include the individual's stature (Height), body mass (Weight), chronological age (Age), and biological sex (Gender).
<|end|>
