Here's your translated Python code into PHP:

```php
function find_repeating_substring($s, $sub) {
    $sub_len = strlen($sub);
    if (substr($s, -$sub_len) === $sub) {
        $indices = [];
        $len = strlen($s);
        for ($i = 0; $i < $len; $i++) {
            if (substr($s, $i, $sub_len) === $sub) {
                $indices[] = $i;
            }
        }
        if (count($indices) < 2) {
            return false;
        }
        $diff = $indices[1] - $indices[0];
        for ($i = 1; $i < count($indices) -1; $i++) {
            if ($indices[$i + 1] - $indices[$i] !== $diff) {
                return false;
            }
        }
        return true;
    }
    return false;
}
```

