FROM product_reviews;
```
This command assumes that the topmost review rating means the highest review_rating. 

However, please note that if there is more than one product with the same highest review rating, this SQL command will only return one of them. If you want to return all products that have the highest review_rating, then you should use a subquery like this:

```sql
SELECT product_name, review_rating 
FROM product_reviews
WHERE review_rating = (SELECT MAX(review_rating) FROM product_reviews);
