7. **Upload Completion Page**: Once the audio content is transcribed and tagged with keywords, it's uploaded and saved to the app's database.

8. **Profile and Settings Page**: This page allows users to view and manage their profiles, adjust app settings, provide feedback, get help, and logout.

This conceptual design aims to deliver a user-friendly UI/UX, making it simple and intuitive for users to navigate through the app. Each stage of the process is well-guided to ensure users can use its features without any confusion.
