Employ your preferred method to construct a fibonacci sequence up to its 10th term. Once completed, employ matplotlib to create a visualization, demonstrating the relationship between the values of the sequence and their corresponding place in the sequence. This task necessitates multi-step reasoning, the plotting action should be executed only after the successful generation of the sequence.
