2. [Leaf](https://github.com/Autumnai/leaf) : Open Machine Intelligence Framework for Hackers. (GPU/CPU)

You could also consider implementing some machine learning models from scratch, for practice and to get used to the Rust syntax. However, for any serious deep learning work, currently Rust may not be the best choice.
