Utilize HTML5 and CSS3 to construct a responsive, horizontally aligned navigation bar on the upper portion of a web page with a dropdown menu. To increase complexity, the dropdown menu should also be horizontally aligned and appear when hovering over one of the main navigation links. Ensure your navigation bar and dropdown are accessible, adding any necessary ARIA roles and properties.
