```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        try {
            int num1 = 10;
            int num2 = 0;
            int result = num1 / num2; // This will throw an exception
            System.out.println("The result is : " + result);
        } catch (ArithmeticException e) {
            // This block is to catch divide-by-zero error
            System.out.println("Error: Dividing by 0 is not permitted!");
        } finally {
            System.out.println("I'm the finally block, I execute regardless of an Exception was thrown or not!");
        }
    }
}
```

