To change the Background we have to alter the CSS. 

Only HTML tags rendered by the ASP.NET server control can be directly controlled through CSS. To target a specific tree node you want to customize, you would need to assign it a CSS class and then style it. However, server controls like `asp:TreeView` render more complex HTML where individual nodes are not easily accessible. 

