Construct a SQL query to find all first names and their corresponding last names from the table "Employees" where the first names begin with "J" and the length of the last name is greater than 5 characters. Additionally, order the results by the last name in descending alphabetical order. 

Table: Employees
Columns: First_Name, Last_Name
<|end|>
<|asst|>
SELECT First_Name, Last_Name
FROM Employees
WHERE First_Name LIKE 'J%' AND LENGTH(Last_Name) > 5
ORDER BY Last_Name DESC
