# Context
[BOSS: I want be major player and profit in agriculture exporting, help me write the full stack software I will needed to success, Product Manager: ## Original Requirements
The boss wants to become a major player and profit in agriculture exporting. He needs a full-stack software solution to achieve this success.

## Product Goals
