    "As a user, I want to be able to track my inventory so that I can manage my stock efficiently",
    "As a user, I want to be able to manage my orders so that I can ensure timely delivery",
    "As a user, I want to be able to generate reports so that I can make informed business decisions",
    "As a user, I want to be able to manage my customers so that I can maintain good relationships",
    "As a user, I want to be able to manage my suppliers so that I can ensure a steady supply of products"
]
