8. **Style Your Components**: Use Vue Material to style your components according to the Material Design guidelines.

9. **Optimize Your App**: Use Vue's performance optimization options, such as lazy loading and code splitting, to improve the speed and responsiveness of your app.

10. **Test Your App**: Make sure to test your app in a variety of environments, including different browsers and mobile devices.

