2. An explanation of the selected model and why it is suitable for this task.
3. Evaluation of the model's performance using appropriate metrics.
4. Visualization of both the actual trend based on past data and the predicted future trend in the same plot for easy comparison. 

The task requires you to program in Python using pandas, sklearn, and matplotlib libraries. You can build your solution as a Jupyter notebook. Your code should be clean, commented, and easy to understand.
