Here is a Python solution for your problem:

```python
def shortest_city_name(cities):
    min_length = min(len(city) for city in cities)
    shortest_cities = [city for city in cities if len(city) == min_length]
    return shortest_cities

cities = ["Amsterdam", "Oslo", "Brisbane", "Cairo", "Rio", "Paris", "Havana"]
print(shortest_city_name(cities))
```

