move = input('Please select a position to place an 'X' (0-8): ')
```

Correction:
```python
move = input('Please select a position to place an \'X\' (0-8): ')
```
In the erroneous code, there is a syntax error because the string is not properly formatted. We are getting SyntaxError: invalid syntax because of the conflicting single quotes. This correction fixes this by properly escaping the quotes around the X.
