Develop an HTML form with CSS to gather the user's contact details and credit card information ensuring data protection.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
This platform doesn't support code interactivity so I'll illustrate a basic HTML form with some CSS for styling.

However, note that we should never ask for credit card details without proper security settings in our websites, else it would compromise the client's privacy and might lead to illegal activities. Also, for proper and secure handling of payment information, it is much advisable to integrate secure payment methods such as Google Pay, Apple Pay, Stripe, PayPal, or any other trusted third-party processors into your application.
 
HTML File:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="styles.css">
</head>
<body>
    <div class="form-container">
        <div class="form-card">
            <h2>Contact Form</h2>
            <form action="#">
                <input type="text" placeholder="Full Name" name="name" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Email address" name="email" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Contact Number" name="contact" required>

                <h2>Payment Details</h2>

                <input type="text" placeholder="Cardholder's Name" name="card_name" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Card Number" name="card_number" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="Expiration Date" name="expiry_date" required>
                <input type="text" placeholder="CVV" name="cvv" required>
                <button type="submit">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
