Now let's explain the corrections:

1. Your hyperlinks are missing the closing `>` for `<a>` tag. Correct structure should be `<a href="url">Link name</a>`
2. All the `href` attributes should ideally start with `http://` or `https://` for compatibility.
3. `target="_blank"` is used to open link into a separate tab or window.
4. `title` attribute is used to show text on mouse hover.
5. `style="text-decoration: none; color: black;"` is used here to remove the default underline of hyperlinks and make their color black.
