Facebook had deprecated their official Java SDK a long time ago and currently don’t offer a new one. However, you can still develop Java-based Facebook applications using alternative libraries such as:

1. RestFB: This is a simple and flexible Facebook Graph API and Old REST API client written in Java.

2. Spring Social for Facebook: Spring Social is an extension of the Spring Framework that allows you to connect your applications with Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) providers such as Facebook and Twitter.

