    Evaluate if two provided strings have identical sets of vowels with similar frequency, disregarding case, position and non-alphabetic characters.
    >>> compare_vowel_sets("Apple, Banana-Orange!", "orange Apple @banana")
    False
    >>> compare_vowel_sets("orange BANANA", "apple orange (banana)")
    True
    >>> compare_vowel_sets("apple#1", "apple apple")
    True
    >>> compare_vowel_sets("Banana", "apple baNAna")
