We can refactor the given code to make it more efficient by utilizing the collections' Counter method. This will not only simplify the code but also allow us to handle counts for different types of fruits instead of just apples. 

Here is refactored Python code:

```python
from collections import Counter

def fruit_count(fruit_basket):
    return Counter(fruit_basket)

