Array Example: 
items = [{"id": 1, "label": "Item 1"}, {"id": 2, "label": "Item 2"}, {"id": 3, "label": "Item 3"}]

Default Checked Items Example:
defaultCheckedItems = [{"id": 1, "label": "Item 1"}, {"id": 3, "label": "Item 3"}]

Given erroneous function:

```javascript
function generateCheckboxes(items) {
    let checkBoxHTML = "";
    for (let i = 0; i < items.length; i++) {
        checkBoxHTML = checkBoxHTML + `<input type="checkbox" id="${items[i].id}"> ${items[i].label}<br>`;
    return checkBoxHTML;
    }
}
```
Please fix the issues and enhance this function to accommodate the new requirements.
