Creating a shimmering and slightly distorted effect on SVG is not directly possible with just SVG as SVG deals with static images not animations. But you can achieve that effect using CSS animations or JavaScript. 

Here is a simple example of how you might create shimmering effect using CSS keyframes:

```css
@keyframes shimmer {
    0% {
        background-position: -200px;
    }
    100% {
        background-position: calc(200px + 100%);
    }
