An additional improvement that could be made is to split the data into train and test sets for an unbiased estimate of the model's performance. 

Please note: ROC AUC can't be directly calculated for multiclass problem. We will have to convert the multiclass problem into binarized form and then the average ROC AUC for each class can be calculated. But it is not really reliable for multi class problem. 

This solution assumes your classes are not ordinal and all predictions for each class are independent. In case of ordinal classes, you might need other strategies.
