}
```

Further, develop a function that forms the shortest palindrome by appending characters at the start of a given string. You need to devise an efficient algorithm for the same:

```c++
string make_palindrome(string str){
    /*
    Algorithm: 
    - Find the longest postfix of the supplied string that is a palindrome.
    - Append to the end of the string the reverse of a string prefix that comes before the palindromic suffix.
    */
}
```
Sample test cases for the create_palindrome function:
```c++
make_palindrome("") // returns ""
make_palindrome("cat") // returns "tacat"
make_palindrome("cato") // returns "otacato"
```
Make sure your new algorithms minimize time complexity.
