ould you also clarify the potential impact of quantum teleportation on the all-encompassing universe of quantum physics, and how it might outline the future path of quantum communication and secure data transmission? Could you also scrutinize the potential outcomes of quantum teleportation on the wider spectrum of quantum physics, and how it might mold the future of quantum communication and secure data transmission?
