Here's an example of how you could do this in Python utilizing Beautiful Soup, which is great for web scraping and parsing HTML documents:

```python
from bs4 import BeautifulSoup

# suppose 'html_doc' is your HTML document
html_doc = """
    <html>
    <body>
        <input type="text" id="name" value="John">
        <input type="password" id="password" value="1234">
    </body>
    </html>
"""

# create a Beautiful Soup object
