# find all 'input' tags with 'type' attribute as 'text'
input_tags = soup.find_all('input', {'type': 'text'})

for tag in input_tags:
    print(tag)
```

In this code, `soup.find_all('input', {'type': 'text'})` locates all 'input' elements containing an attribute 'type' equals to 'text'.
