Yes, below is the equivalent Perl code for your Python function:

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;

sub extract_data {
    my $str = shift;

    if($str =~ / / or $str =~ /;/) {
        my @split_array = split /[ ;]/, $str;
        return \@split_array;
    } else {
        my $upper_case_count = grep {$_ % 2 == 0 && substr($str, $_, 1) =~ /[A-Z]/} 0 .. length($str) - 1;
        my $digits_sum = grep {$_ % 2 != 0} map {/\d/ ? $_ : ()} split //, $str;
        return $upper_case_count + $digits_sum;
    }
}

my $res = extract_data("Your string goes here");
print "@$res";
