Please note that the shimmering effect could differ greatly depending on the exact effect you're looking for. The blur-based animation here is a rather simple demonstration. Using SVG `smil` animations, `clipPaths`, etc. can create more advanced animations but also require deeper knowledge of SVG manipulation.
