Develop an efficient and optimized heuristic greedy algorithm for a selected complex problem in computational theory. Ensure the algorithm minimally satisfies the following conditions:

a) The algorithm must demonstrate enhanced decision-making abilities towards specific problematization.

b) Explain why the greedy approach fits best for this problem and highlight its time and space complexity.

