Craft a Python code snippet that establishes a robust, optimized connection to a PostgreSQL-powered Relational Database Management System (RDBMS), with a paramount focus on complying with the zenith of cybersecurity standards and computational efficiency. This task requires a multi-tiered approach, involving the initiation of the connection, the integration of security measures, and the optimization of the code for enhanced performance, all while ensuring the code's resilience to potential disruptions and its streamlined execution.
