You are also required to write custom functions to evaluate metrics of your model such as Precision, Recall and F1-Score alongside Accuracy. Visualize the loss reduction and accuracy improvement over epochs. Discuss how each metric is important in the context of the Breast Cancer prediction task. Make sure your model is able to generalize well and interpret your results.
