  <version>0.34.30</version>
</dependency>
```

3. ReverseMarkdown: Maven link
```xml
<dependency>
  <groupId>net.karlmoad</groupId>
  <artifactId>ReverseMarkdown</artifactId>
  <version>1.0.8</version>
</dependency>
```

Also, please note that these transformations (HTML -> Markdown) are not always 1:1, so you may lose some data or formatting along the way. Always check the output to make sure it's what you expect.
