<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here is the corrected version of the code:

```Python 
import time

class Person:
    def __init__(self, name):
        self.name = "Hello, " + name

    def timer_decorator(func):
        def wrapper(self):
            start_time = time.time()
            result = func(self)
            end_time = time.time()
            print(f"Time taken to execute : {end_time - start_time}")
            return result
        return wrapper
    
    @timer_decorator
    def greet_person(self):
