In order to make the SVG pulse or glow, we need to add a CSS animation. This can be achieved mainly using CSS. Here’s a simple example of what this may look like:

```html
<style>
    @keyframes pulse {
      0% {
        filter: brightness(100%);
      }
      50% {
        filter: brightness(150%);
      }
      100% {
        filter: brightness(100%);
      }
    }

    .glow-svg {
      animation: pulse 2s infinite;
    }
</style>

