    "As a patient, I want my disease history to be accurately recorded so that my treatment can be effectively managed",
    "As a pharmacist, I want to access the patient's disease records so that I can provide the right medication",
    "As a hospital cashier, I want the POS system to be integrated with the patient recording system so that billing can be done accurately and efficiently"
]
