## Requirement Analysis
The product should be a combination of a patient recording system and a POS system. The patient recording system should be able to accurately track and record the diseases of patients. The POS system should be able to accurately record hospital transactions. The two systems should be integrated for seamless operations.

## Requirement Pool
```python
[
    ("Develop a user-friendly interface for the patient recording system", "P0"),
    ("Implement a reliable and efficient POS system", "P0"),
    ("Ensure accurate tracking and recording of patient's diseases", "P0"),
    ("Integrate the patient recording system and the POS system", "P0"),
    ("Provide support for customization and scalability", "P1")
]
```

## UI Design draft
The user interface should be clean and intuitive. The patient recording system should have fields for patient's name, age, gender, disease history, current disease, and treatment plan. The POS system should have fields for patient's name, services availed, cost, payment method, and transaction status. The two systems should be accessible from a main dashboard and should have a consistent design theme.

## Anything UNCLEAR
There are no unclear points., Architect: ## Implementation approach
We will use Flask, a lightweight and flexible Python web framework, to build the web application. Flask-SQLAlchemy will be used for database operations, and Flask-WTForms for form handling. We will also use Flask-Login for user authentication. For the POS system, we will use Stripe API for handling payments. The patient recording system and the POS system will be integrated using Flask's blueprint feature. The difficult point is to ensure the seamless integration of the two systems and the accurate recording of patient's diseases and hospital transactions.

