Here is the function 'modification'. This function sums up all the elements in both lists, check if the total sum is an even number. If the total sum is an odd number, then it becomes impossible to convert one list into an exclusive even-number collection while keeping the sum over both lists the same. This is because an odd number can't be obtained by adding an even number of even numbers. 

