d you also shed light on the potential influences of quantum entanglement on the extensive discipline of quantum mechanics, and how it might mold the future path of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement? Could you also assess the potential repercussions of quantum entanglement on the wide array of quantum mechanics, and how it might sculpt the future of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement?
