 also illuminate the potential influences of quantum superposition on the expansive field of quantum mechanics, and how it might mold the future direction of quantum computing and quantum superposition? Could you also assess the potential impacts of quantum superposition on the wide-ranging discipline of quantum mechanics, and how it might chart the future of quantum computing and quantum superposition?
