If you are constructing a pagoda with wooden cubes and each layer decreases by two cubes as you elevate, how many cubes will you need to establish a pagoda with 7 tiers?
<|end|>
<|asst|>
To construct this pagoda, we will start with the largest level at the bottom and decrease by two cubes each tier as we go up. We thus have:

Tier 1 (bottom): 7*7= 49 cubes
Tier 2: 5*5= 25 cubes
Tier 3: 3*3= 9 cubes
Tier 4: 1 cube
The rest of the tiers (5, 6, and 7) will not add cubes as they don't have a width.

So in total we would need: 49+25+9+1 = 84 cubes.
<|end|>


