- [PHPUnit-GUI](https://github.com/NSinopoli/PHPUnit_GUI): Comes with extra features like log generation, assert generation, exception generation, etc.  
- [VisualPHPUnit](https://github.com/NSinopoli/VisualPHPUnit): A nice visual interface for PHPUnit, allowing you to run and view tests within the browser.
- [SublimePHPUnit](https://github.com/stuartherbert/sublime-phpunit):  It's a plugin for Sublime Text editor and not exactly a standalone GUI. But if you use Sublime, it might be a good fit.

All of these are quite basic though, they mainly just provide a way to run your tests from the browser (or editor) and display results. If you need more functionality, you might have to consider other testing frameworks or create custom solutions.
<|end|>


