But also implements a method that can change the value of the "yearsLived" attribute and a method that can add a new life event to the "lifeEvents" attribute. Each method should take a parameter for the new value. The function should also check if the input parameters are of the correct type (number for "yearsLived" and string for new life events) before making any changes. In case of any invalid input, throw an error. After any change is made to the object, print out the updated object.
