    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
In the above HTML code, we have included Bootstrap and jQuery CDN in the head section. Inside the body we have a `div` which acts as a Bootstrap container. Inside this container, we have a `h1` tag which contains the initial text content, and a `button` that will be used to change the text content.

JavaScript / jQuery:
