Write a Python program that uses pandas to load this data: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/datasciencedojo/datasets/master/titanic.csv. Filter the Women onboard the Titanic, calculate the survival rate and compare it to men's survival rate. Also, find the average age of surviving women and men.
