4. In the `intricate_sort(s)` function, unwanted characters were used in the string split method. I have replaced with correct one.
5. The substring slicing at the end of the string to remove the extra space has been corrected too.
6. In the `unscramble_string(s)` funtion, again the split method contained wrong characters.
7. Characters were wrongly used in the place of ='=', '[]', '()' and '{}'. I have replaced them with correct ones.
8. Also, some syntax errors like missing brackets were corrected.
