Refactor the given script using object-oriented programming, ensuring the program checks for invalid values and out of bound errors. Also, the maximum limit of elements should not exceed 20 in the data array. 

MAX_ELEMENTS = 15
data = [0] * MAX_ELEMENTS

def update_value(position, number):
