```sql
CREATE TABLE rugby_stats (
    id INT,
    club VARCHAR(255),
    played INT,
    won INT,
    drawn INT,
    lost INT,
    points_for INT,
    points_against INT,
    tries_for INT,
    tries_against INT,
    try_bonus INT,
    losing_bonus INT,
    points INT
);
```

Then, we can insert the data into the table:

```sql
-- Insert data here
