## UI Design draft
The website should have a clean, modern design with intuitive navigation. The homepage should prominently display the latest news. The content management dashboard should be easy to use with clear options for adding, editing, and removing content. The viewer count visualizer should be displayed on the dashboard in a clear and visually appealing manner.

