mmunication and secure data transmission? Could you also clarify the potential influence of quantum teleportation on the comprehensive field of quantum physics, and how it might delineate the future trajectory of quantum communication and secure data transmission? Could you also assess the potential repercussions of quantum teleportation on the broad panorama of quantum physics, and how it might mold the future of quantum communication and secure data transmission?
