To systematically classify an assembly of entities based on their individual characteristics and nested sub-attributes, a resultant output encapsulating these systematically arranged constituents must be formulated. Consider the multidimensional array:
let array = [
    { name: "John", type: "fruit", subAttributes: {"color": "red", "weight": "1kg"} },
    { name: "Paul", type: "vegetable", subAttributes: {"color": "green", "weight": "500g"} },
    { name: "Ringo", type: "fruit", subAttributes: {"color": "yellow", "weight": "1.5kg"} }
]
