Write a jQuery code snippet that changes the text color of all p tags to red when a specific event occurs (i.e., a user clicks a button or hovers over an element). Additionally, your code should include a counter that tracks and displays the number of times these tags have had their color changed. Do this without using jQuery's css() function.
