 influences of quantum superposition on the broad universe of quantum mechanics, and how it might mold the future trajectory of quantum computing and quantum superposition? Could you also evaluate the potential impacts of quantum superposition on the vast expanse of quantum mechanics, and how it might plot the future course of quantum computing and quantum superposition?
