### 2. Model Training Phase
For enhanced performance, train the model using the AWS infrastructure, specifically the Amazon SageMaker service, which is tailored to accelerate machine learning tasks.

```Python
import sagemaker
from sagemaker.pytorch import PyTorch

estimator = PyTorch(entry_point='train.py',
                    role=sagemaker.get_execution_role(), 
                    framework_version='1.3.1',
