print(s1[1]) # This will output: e

print(s1) # This will output: Hello

print(s1 == s2) # This will output: True

print(s1 == s3) # This will output: False
```

We can handle Unicode sequences in the similar way as we did with ASCII sequences:

```python
s = MyString("𝓗𝓮𝓵𝓵𝓸")
print(len(s)) # This will output: 5
print(s[1]) # This will output: 𝓮
