Extract all the elements from an XML that match the 'student' tag. Additionally, detect instances where elements contain certain attributes (such as a student's course being "Mathematics" and grade being "A") and print special messages for these. Ensure your program can manage unpredictably nested XML. An example of XML string is given below:
