Formulate an intricate procedural algorithm that expertly discerns between prime numbers; integers exclusively divisible by 1 and themselves, and composite numbers; integers with multiple positive factors greater than two, from a currently available data set embodying numerical values. 
[10, 11, 12, 13, 14, 15]
