Craft a while encapsulation in Java language, whose purpose is to manifest all numerosities in the even category within the gamut of 0 to 20.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here is a simple Java program that accomplishes this task using a while loop.

```java
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int num = 0;
        while (num <= 20) {
            if (num % 2 == 0) {
                System.out.println(num);
            }
            num++;
        }
    }
}
```
The loop in this program starts at 0 and increments by 1 each time through the loop. Each time through the loop, the program checks if the current number is even (i.e., if the remainder when the number is divided by 2 is 0). If the number is even, the program prints the number. The loop continues until the number reaches 20.
