This script will return the number of business days within the given range after taking into considerations weekends and both public and custom holidays. 

However, when implementing this function in production, a more robust solution for handling the addition of custom holidays and supporting different countries may be needed.

NOTE: The 'holidays' library in python is dependent on the 'dateutil' library to determine the holidays accurately. Depending on the calendar rules of a specific country, the 'holidays' library may or may not be accurate or complete. Always verify the results with a reliable source.
