```js
// we're using Vue.JS as our framework in this example

new Vue({
  el: '#app',
  data: {
    user: {
      username: '',
      password: ''
    }
  },
  methods: {
    login() {
      if (navigator.onLine) {
        // do online authentication
      } else {
        // do offline authentication
      }
    }
  },
  computed: {
    isLoginFormValid() {
      return !!this.user.username && !!this.user.password
    }
  }
})
```
The HTML code for our login form might look like this:

```html
<div id="app" class="container h-100">
  <div class="row align-items-center h-100">
