? Could you also shed light on the potential influences of quantum entanglement on the expansive discipline of quantum mechanics, and how it might shape the future trajectory of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement? Could you also evaluate the potential impacts of quantum entanglement on the extensive discipline of quantum mechanics, and how it might direct the future of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement?
