Here is the code:

```python
import pandas as pd
import re

# read the file
with open('file.txt', 'r') as file:
    data = file.read()

# find all URLs starting with http or https (a very simple regex, for more accurate ones look online)
urls = re.findall('http[s]?://(?:[a-zA-Z]|[0-9]|[$-_@.&+]|[!*\\(\\),]|(?:%[0-9a-fA-F][0-9a-fA-F]))+', data)

# create a DataFrame
df = pd.DataFrame(urls, columns=['URLs'])

# check the data
print(df)
```

Remember to replace 'file.txt' with your own txt file path.

