For instance, if the input reads `incrList(Arrays.asList(1, 2, 3))`, ensure that your output reads `[2, 3, 4]`. Similarly, an input like `incrList(Arrays.asList(5, 3, 5, 2, 3, 3, 9, 0, 123))` must result in an output such as `[6, 4, 6, 3, 4, 4, 10, 1, 124]`.

