Implement an algorithm to remove duplicates from a sorted doubly linked list without using any extra space. Also, the implemented algorithm should preserve the original order of elements. The function should return the modified linked list.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
I will use Python to solve this problem, and here is a simple algorithm to remove duplicates from a sorted doubly linked list. The types of the nodes holding the data of the linked list are considered as integers. 

Here's a Node class representing each node in the doubly linked list:

```python
class Node:  
    def __init__(self, data=None):  
        self.data = data
        self.next = None
        self.prev = None
```

Then, I will implement the algorithm that takes the head of the doubly linked list as an argument and returns the head of the new linked list with duplicates removed:

```python
def removeDuplicates(head):
    if head is None:
        return None
    
    curr_node = head
    next_node = head.next
    
    while next_node is not None:
        # If curr_node and next_node contains same value, then delete next node
        if curr_node.data == next_node.data:
            next_node = next_node.next
            curr_node.next = next_node
            if next_node:
                next_node.prev = curr_node
        # Otherwise, update curr_node and next_node
        else:
            curr_node = next_node
            next_node = next_node.next
                
    # Return updated head node
    return head
```

This function traverses the given sorted doubly linked list from left to right. For each node, if the node has the same value as its next node, the function removes the next node. Otherwise, it moves on to the next node. The function keeps doing this until it reaches the end of the list. Finally, the function returns the head of the new list.

This way, we can remove duplicates from the list preserving the original order without using any extra space. The time complexity of this solution is O(n), where n is the number of elements in the list.
<|end|>


