    - `dob DATE NOT NULL`: This creates a "dob" column to hold a date value. Again, this can't be empty due to `NOT NULL`.
    
    - `email VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL`: This creates an "email" column that can hold strings up to 255 characters. It needs to be unique and cannot be null.

