```javascript
const { ApolloServer, gql } = require('apollo-server');
const typeDefs = gql`type Query {forecast(input: InputType): OutputType}`;
const resolvers = {Query: {forecast: (parent, args, context, info) => {/* call ML model */}}};
const server = new ApolloServer({ typeDefs, resolvers });
server.listen().then(({ url }) => {console.log(`🚀  Server ready at ${url}`);});
```

Using this approach, the trained model will be able to generate instant forecasts upon request via the GraphQL API endpoint.

