on and data analysis? Could you also clarify the potential influence of quantum computing on the expansive field of quantum physics, and how it might delineate the future trajectory of high-velocity data manipulation and data analysis? Could you also assess the potential impacts of quantum computing on the vast realm of quantum physics, and how it might mold the future of high-velocity data manipulation and data analysis?
