Craft an SQL inquiry in order to evaluate the total of rental costs for customers who took a lease of a movie in the course of the preceding week. Consider optimising your query for efficiency and ensure it can handle large datasets. Please utilise the table named "Rentals" with columns named "CustomerId", "RentalDate", and "RentalFee".
