```python
def calculate_net_compensation():
    # Ingest total monetary compensation
    total_compensation = float(input("Enter your total monetary compensation: "))

    # Ingest fiscal withholdings
    fiscal_withholdings = float(input("Enter your fiscal withholdings: "))

    # Ingest applicable assessment percentage
    assessment_percentage = float(input("Enter your assessment percentage: "))

    # Calculate net compensation
    net_compensation = (total_compensation - fiscal_withholdings) * (1 - assessment_percentage / 100)

    return net_compensation

print(calculate_net_compensation())
```

