    """Devise a function advanced_vowel_counter that receives a string representing
    a word and responds with the cumulative count of vowels in it. It will include 'a', 'e', 'i', 'o', 'u', and 'y' ONLY when they occur as the final letter
    of the word. This function must entertain case sensitivity as well as special symbols.

