Construct an intricate and multilayered systemic architecture for the enduring consolidation and classification of a myriad of data associated with the broad terms of personnel demographics, job intricacies, and professional qualifications existing within the structure of a business entity, whilst ensuring such a system allows for effective, time-efficient, and straightforward data retrieval when necessitated.
