Write a Java program to query a list of customers and produce a report containing the customer's total purchases.
[
{ "firstName": "John", "lastName": "Smith", "purchases": [20, 30, 70] },
{ "firstName": "Mark", "lastName": "Jones", "purchases": [90, 40, 50] },
{ "firstName": "Patricia", "lastName": "Williams", "purchases": [10, 20, 90] }
]
