Design an algorithm that creates a random password of 12 characters, consisting of at least one uppercase letter, one lowercase letter, one digit, and one special character from the set `!$%^&*()`. Furthermore, ensure that characters do not repeat in the generated password.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here's an algorithm in Python:

```python
import random
import string

def generate_password():
    # Create the sets of characters we'll be using
    uppercase_letters = set(string.ascii_uppercase)
    lowercase_letters = set(string.ascii_lowercase)
    digits = set(string.digits)
    special_chars = set('!$%^&*()')

    # Choose one character from each set
    uppercase = random.choice(list(uppercase_letters))
    uppercase_letters.remove(uppercase)

    lowercase = random.choice(list(lowercase_letters))
    lowercase_letters.remove(lowercase)

    digit = random.choice(list(digits))
    digits.remove(digit)

    special_char = random.choice(list(special_chars))
    special_chars.remove(special_char)

    # Combine our chosen characters and the remaining characters in a list
    remaining_chars = list(uppercase_letters | lowercase_letters | digits | special_chars)

    # Choose 8 more random characters, without replacement
    extra_chars = random.sample(remaining_chars, 8)

    # Combine all the characters into a list
    password_list = [uppercase, lowercase, digit, special_char] + extra_chars

    # Randomly shuffle the list to create the final password
    random.shuffle(password_list)
    password = ''.join(password_list)

    return password

generated_password = generate_password()
print(generated_password)
```

This code first creates sets of uppercase letters, lowercase letters, digits, and special characters. It then chooses one character from each set, removes it from the set to avoid repetition, and combines them with the remaining characters. Then, the algorithm picks 8 more characters without replacement from the combined set, shuffles the list, and converts it to a string to create the final password.
<|end|>


