  if page_number is 1 or page_number is total_pages:
    print page_number   # always print first and last page

  else if page_number is current_page - 1 or current_page or current_page + 1:
    print page_number   # always print two pages before and after current page

  else if page_number is 2 and current_page is more than 4:
    print '...'   # if more than two pages between first page and current page, print '...'

  else if page_number is total_pages - 1 and current_page is less than total_pages - 3:
    print '...'   # if more than two pages between current page and last page, print '...'

  else continue   # else don't print anything (skip the loop iteration)
```

