Develop a Python function that accepts a list of numerical values as input. The function should not only return a sorted list, but should also remove any duplicates. Additionally, the function should be able to handle missing values, treating null or None values as zero. Write unit tests to confirm the accuracy of your function. Prioritize high efficiency when approaching this problem.
