To create the SQL query to extract both the highest and lowest values of a specific attribute within a designated table, you can use the following query:

```sql
SELECT
    MIN(myattribute) AS min_value,
    MAX(myattribute) AS max_value
FROM
    mytable;
```

This query will return one row with two columns, `min_value` containing the lowest value of `myattribute`, and `max_value` containing the highest value of `myattribute` in the `mytable`.
