Architect a sophisticated Java software solution capable of ingesting two individual, undefined sequences of characters. The application must then analyze, compare, and return the count of characters in whichever string boasts the superior length.

String uniqueCharacterString1 = "Hello";
String uniqueCharacterString2 = "World!";
