Here is a Java solution to solve the problem:

```java
public class Main {

    public static void main(String[] args) {

        String uniqueCharacterString1 = "Hello";
        String uniqueCharacterString2 = "World!";

        int count = countCharacters(uniqueCharacterString1, uniqueCharacterString2);
        System.out.println("The count of characters in the longest string is: " + count);
    }

    private static int countCharacters(String str1, String str2) {
        return Math.max(str1.length(), str2.length());
    }

}
