Compose a SQL database querying statement that not only uncovers all university professors, lecturers, and educational personnel who boast in excess of a decade's worth of professional teaching expertise within the realm of higher education institutions but also sorts them based on their teaching field. In addition to this, ensure to further filter the data to exclude any teaching personnel who have received any disciplinary actions within the last five years. Also, provide their latest published work in the same field, if any, alongside the citation count for the publication.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Assuming you have a relational database system with three tables namely `Personnel`, `Discipline` and `Publication` with necessary columns, the SQL query could be somewhat like this:

```sql
SELECT 
    P.name, 
    P.teaching_field, 
    P.start_year, 
    B.publication_name, 
    B.citation_count
FROM 
    Personnel P
LEFT JOIN 
    (SELECT 
        personnel_id, 
        MAX(publication_date) most_recent_date 
    FROM 
        Publication
    GROUP BY 
        personnel_id) A
ON
    P.id = A.personnel_id
LEFT JOIN 
    Publication B
ON
    A.personnel_id = B.personnel_id
AND 
    A.most_recent_date = B.publication_date
WHERE 
    YEAR(CURDATE()) - P.start_year >= 10
AND 
    P.id NOT IN 
    (SELECT 
        personnel_id 
     FROM 
        Discipline 
     WHERE 
        action_date BETWEEN DATE_SUB(CURDATE(), INTERVAL 5 YEAR) AND CURDATE())
ORDER BY 
    P.teaching_field;
```

In this query, we assume that:
- The `Personnel` table includes columns `id`, `name`, `teaching_field`, `start_year`,
- The `Discipline` table includes columns `personnel_id`, `action_date`,
- The `Publication` table includes columns `personnel_id`, `publication_date`, `publication_name`, `citation_count`. 

Please adjust tables and column names accordingly.
Please note that MySQL's `YEAR(CURDATE()) - P.start_year >= 10` part of the query calculates how many years the personnel has been teaching. The `NOT IN` operator is used to exclude personnel who have been subject to disciplinary actions within the last five years. The `LEFT JOIN` syntax allows to add the latest publication information along with the citation count per personnel if any. The query results are ordered by teaching field.
