## Original Requirements
The boss wants a strategy that trades in Binance which can automatically discover possible trade strategies and execute them independently.

## Product Goals
```python
[
    "Develop an automated trading bot for Binance",
    "The bot should be able to discover and implement trading strategies autonomously",
    "The bot should have a user-friendly interface for monitoring and adjusting settings"
]
```

## User Stories
```python
[
    "As a user, I want to be able to set up the bot easily so that I can start trading as soon as possible",
    "As a user, I want the bot to discover profitable trading strategies automatically so I don't have to constantly monitor the market",
    "As a user, I want to be able to adjust the bot's settings according to my risk tolerance and investment goals",
    "As a user, I want to be able to monitor the bot's performance and trading history easily",
    "As a user, I want the bot to execute trades automatically once it has discovered a profitable strategy"
]
```

## Competitive Analysis
```python
[
    "3Commas: Offers automated trading bots for multiple exchanges, including Binance. However, it doesn't have a feature for discovering trading strategies autonomously",
    "Cryptohopper: Allows users to backtest and implement trading strategies, but doesn't discover strategies automatically",
    "HaasOnline: Offers a wide range of automated trading bots, but requires technical knowledge to set up and use",
    "TradeSanta: Provides simple and easy-to-use trading bots, but lacks advanced features like strategy discovery",
    "Zignaly: Supports Binance and offers automated trading, but doesn't have a feature for discovering trading strategies autonomously",
    "Gunbot: Offers a wide range of features and supports Binance, but is complex to use and doesn't discover strategies automatically",
    "ProfitTrailer: Supports Binance and offers automated trading, but lacks a feature for discovering trading strategies autonomously"
]
```

