Show me the syntax for this in Perl:
script
const intersection = (pairOfIntegers1, pairOfIntegers2) => {
   let commonStart = Math.max(pairOfIntegers1[0], pairOfIntegers2[0]);
   let commonEnd = Math.min(pairOfIntegers1[1], pairOfIntegers2[1]);
   
   if (commonEnd - commonStart < 1) {
       return "NO";
   }

   let intersectionLength = commonEnd - commonStart + 1;
   for (let i = 2; i <= Math.sqrt(intersectionLength); i++) {
      if (intersectionLength % i === 0) return "NO";
   }

   return "YES";
};
I would like to understand the logic, so please add comments to the translated code.
