To process this task, I'll use several libraries such as pandas for data manipulation, sklearn for machine learning, matplotlib for data visualization, and requests to fetch data from the URL. Here's a simple demonstration:

```python
# Import necessary libraries
import pandas as pd
import matplotlib.pyplot as plt
from sklearn import svm, metrics
from sklearn.model_selection import train_test_split
from sklearn.feature_extraction.text import TfidfVectorizer
import requests
from io import StringIO

# Fetch data from URL
url = 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/emmanueliarussi/DataScienceCapstone/master/3_MidtermProjects/ProjectRTS/data/test.csv'

data = requests.get(url).content
df = pd.read_csv(StringIO(data.decode('utf-8')))

# Preview the data
