Design a Java programming solution that carries out the task of reversively transposing a sequence of elements, not only embodied in a simple ASCII bordered textual arrangement but also considering Unicode characters. This must cater for less common characters and text elements such as emojis, apostrophes and international characters. The solution should also account for edge cases such as null or empty inputs and handle exceptions appropriately.
