Yes, there are several good grid-hosting companies out there that offer .NET stacks. Here are some of them:

1. Microsoft Azure: One of the most popular choices when it comes to .NET hosting. Microsoft Azure provides a comprehensive suite of cloud services that developers can use to build, deploy and manage applications.

2. AWS (Amazon Web Services): It offers support for .NET and other popular stacks. 

3. AppHarbor: A .NET Platform as a Service. AppHarbor will build, run and host your .NET application, giving you a scalable infrastructure at a reasonable price.

