Here is a corrected CSS fragment that utilizes CSS Flexbox for creating a responsive user registration interface. 

```
.container {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 100%;
  padding-top: 10px;
}

.registerForm {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 25px auto;
}

