    "Bonanza: A user-friendly platform with a focus on unique and handmade items",
    "Webstore: A free platform for buyers and sellers, but with less traffic and fewer product categories",
    "ShopGoodwill: An online auction site run by Goodwill Industries with a focus on secondhand items"
]
```

