For the real-time bidding system, Django Channels will be used. Django Channels extends Django to handle WebSockets, HTTP2, and other protocols. 

The auction deadline system will be implemented using Celery, an asynchronous task queue/job queue based on distributed message passing. 

The notification system will be implemented using Django's built-in messaging framework. 

The website will be secured using Django's built-in security features, which include protection against cross-site scripting (XSS), cross-site request forgery (CSRF), and SQL injection. 

