The code you are looking to convert uses the Boto3, the AWS SDK for Python, making it specific to the Python language. Unfortunately, PHP does not have a direct equivalent. However, you can accomplish the same task in PHP using the AWS SDK for PHP. Below is equivalent PHP code:

```php
<?php

require 'vendor/autoload.php';

use Aws\DynamoDb\Exception\DynamoDbException;
use Aws\DynamoDb\Marshaler;

$credentials = new Aws\Credentials\Credentials('your_access_key', 'your_secret_key');

