} catch (DynamoDbException $e) {
    echo "Unable to get item:\n";
    echo $e->getMessage() . "\n";
}
```

In PHP, you start by including the necessary AWS SDK using Composer (a PHP dependency manager). With imports, PHP uses the keyword `use` to bring in specific classes.

