Here's the incorrect code:

```python
from sklearn.cluster import KMeans
import numpy as np

kmeans = KMeans(n_cluster=2, random_state=0)
dataset = np.array([[5,7], [1,2], [7,9], [10,2], [2,5]])
kmeans.fit(dataset)
labels = kmeans.predict([[5,7], [1,2], [7,9], [10,2]])
