How can you navigate through code in Visual Studio Code in a .Net project like in Visual Studio? What I mean is in Visual Studio I can see the active link to the source i.e. some interface, class, etc. In Visual Studio Code I only see the patch.  I know I can go to it with , but if there is a way to do it with mouse clicking?
