3. **Adjusting the JVM argument**: Make sure the `-D` argument is pointing to the correct directory. If your VLC installation is in "C:\\Program Files\\VideoLAN\\VLC", then your `-D` argument should be `-Djna.library.path=C:\\Program Files\\VideoLAN\\VLC`.

