Moreover, the solution must be optimized for a large number of queries. Also, implement unit tests to ensure the proper functioning of the code.

Below is a piece of code with obsolete and unoptimized routines. Review and update the code according to the above requirements.

Table Name: contacts
Key: contact_id
Value: 42
New status: 'inactive'

