<|asst|>
The PHP equivalent of the Go code you posted would be:

```php
<?php

function countDistinctCharacters($str) {
    $distinctChars = array();

    $str = strtolower($str);
    
    for ($i = 0; $i < strlen($str); $i++) {
        $char = $str[$i];
        if (ctype_alpha($char)) {
            $distinctChars[$char] = true;
        }
    }

    return count($distinctChars);
}
?>
