              [ 9, 10, 11, 4, 5, 3, 5],
              [13, 14, 15, 5, 6, 7, 8],
              [17, 18, 19, 5, 3, 2, 5]])
Pay attention that if the high index is out-of-bound, we should constrain it to the bound.
How to solve it? Thanks
A:
&lt;code&gt;
import numpy as np
a = np.array([[[ 0,  1,  2,  3, 5, 6, 7, 8],
               [ 4,  5,  6,  7, 5, 3, 2, 5],
               [ 8,  9, 10, 11, 4, 5, 3, 5]],
