# Context
[BOSS: Design a ecommerce website like eBay where user can post their product online and others can bid the product like auction. The auction product also have a deadline, Product Manager: ## Original Requirements
The boss wants us to design an ecommerce website similar to eBay where users can post their products online and others can bid on the product like an auction. The auctioned product should also have a deadline.

## Product Goals
```python
[
    "Create a user-friendly ecommerce platform for auctioning products",
    "Ensure secure and reliable bidding process",
    "Implement an efficient system for auction deadlines"
]
```

## User Stories
```python
[
    "As a user, I want to post my product for auction so that I can sell it to the highest bidder",
    "As a user, I want to bid on a product so that I can purchase it if I have the highest bid",
    "As a user, I want to see the deadline for the auction so that I can place my bid on time",
    "As a user, I want to receive notifications about the status of my bid so that I can increase my bid if necessary",
    "As a user, I want a secure platform to ensure my financial transactions are safe"
]
```

## Competitive Analysis
```python
[
    "eBay: The most popular online auction platform with a wide variety of products and a reliable bidding system",
    "Amazon Auctions: Offers a similar service but with the backing of Amazon's customer service and delivery network",
    "eBid: A smaller platform with lower fees, but less traffic and fewer products",
    "Listia: A unique platform where users can bid on items using credits instead of money",
    "Bonanza: A user-friendly platform with a focus on unique and handmade items",
    "Webstore: A free platform for buyers and sellers, but with less traffic and fewer product categories",
    "ShopGoodwill: An online auction site run by Goodwill Industries with a focus on secondhand items"
]
```

