2. Event-based: If your 'IsActiveFlag' should switch based on external events or triggers, you could use something like Azure Event Grid to react to these events and update your 'IsActiveFlag' accordingly.

3. Manual trigger: You can create a pipeline with a manual trigger (which can be linked with a HTTP endpoint) and when you want to make any records active, you just need to trigger the HTTP endpoint.

