Pattern: 
\b[A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+@[A-Za-z0-9.-]+\.[A-Z|a-z]{2,7}\b

Explanation: 
- Start with \b to require a word boundary.
- [A-Za-z0-9._%+-]+ matches 1 or more alphanumeric characters, periods, underscores, percent signs, plus signs, or hyphens.
- @ symbol
- [A-Za-z0-9.-]+ matches 1 or more alphanumeric characters, periods, or hyphens.
- \. matches a dot.
- [A-Z|a-z]{2,7} matches 2 to 7 uppercase or lowercase letters.
- End with \b to require a word boundary.
