To implement this application, you would need to follow the MEAN (MongoDB, Express.js, Angular.js and Node.js) stack structure. Here's a basic breakdown:

Front-end (Angular.js):

1. Design a user interface using HTML, CSS, and Bootstrap. Angularjs will be the main driver for managing data and UI interaction. 

2. A search bar can be implemented that listens for user input — when user enters data, send a GET request to the back-end server.

3. Apply filters such as release year, genre, and rating. This will require additional GET requests to the server with specific parameters.

