cognitive computing? Could you also elucidate the potential effects of neuromorphic computing on the all-encompassing discipline of neurobiology, and how it might mold the future path of cognitive neuroscience and cognitive computing? Could you also evaluate the potential results of neuromorphic computing on the vast expanse of neurobiology, and how it might steer the future of cognitive neuroscience and cognitive computing?
