Here is the corrected and modified code based on your problem description:

```python
def analyze_Text(text):
    position_dict = {}

    for i, char in enumerate(text):
        if char in position_dict:
            position_dict[char].append(i)
        else:
            position_dict[char] = [i]

    return position_dict


def compare_Texts(text1_dict, text2_dict):
    comparing_dict = {}

    for char, positions in text1_dict.items():
        if char in text2_dict and text1_dict[char]==text2_dict[char]:
            comparing_dict[char] = len(positions)

    return comparing_dict
```

Testing this with your example sentences gives:

