Write a while loop in Java to print out the even integers from 20 to 2 in decreasing order.
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Here is the Java code that uses a while loop to print out the even integers from 20 to 2 in decreasing order.

```java
public class Main
{
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        int number = 20; // initial number

        while(number >= 2) {  // condition
            if (number % 2 == 0) {  // if the number is even
                System.out.println(number);
            }
            number--;  // decrease the number
        }
    }
}
```
When this code is executed, it will output the even integers from 20 to 2 in decreasing order.
