bool digits_in_order(string num){
  for(char c : num)
    if(!isdigit(c))
      throw invalid_argument("Non-numeric character found.");

  for(int i = 0; i < num.size()-1; i++)
    if(num[i] > num[i+1])
      return false;
    
  return true;
}
would you mind providing a brief explanation for each part of the python code?
