You can adjust `stdDeviation` in `feGaussianBlur` to control the size of the glow. Increasing `stdDeviation` will create a larger glow. The values in `feColorMatrix` can be adjusted to change the color and intensity of the glow. If you wish to adjust the colors, I strongly recommend reading more about SVG color matrices and how they work.
