Im learning how to use pygame from a youtube and now im done with the video ive taken the game further by adding new enemies altering speeds and background objects .i'd also like to take the game further by adding a feature that allows you to do a 'mega jump' to avoid a large amount of enemies but i want to make it so it can only be used once every 5 seconds and when you use it the 5 second timer resets.
i will link the code below

if event.type == pygame.KEYDOWN: #if any key pressed
    if event.key == pygame.K_w: #checking for specific key
        if player_rect.bottom > 299:
            player_grav = -22.5
    if event.key == pygame.K_e: #checking for specific key
        if player_rect.bottom > 299:
            player_grav -= 30 #here is where the jump should be but i have no idea what to do
<|end|>
<|asst|>
You would need to add a cooldown mechanic for the "mega jump" ability. Here's one way of doing it:

First, declare a global variable to keep track of the time when it was last used.  

```python
last_mega_jump_time = pygame.time.get_ticks()
```

Inside your game loop (and ideally, after handling your event loop), you have to check the time elapsed since the last mega jump:

```python
current_time = pygame.time.get_ticks()
time_since_last_mega_jump = current_time - last_mega_jump_time
```

And when the 'E' key is pressed, check if at least 5000 milliseconds (5 seconds) has passed:

```python
if event.type == pygame.KEYDOWN:
    if event.key == pygame.K_w:
        if player_rect.bottom > 299:
            player_grav = -22.5
    if event.key == pygame.K_e:
        if player_rect.bottom > 299 and time_since_last_mega_jump >= 5000: #5000 milliseconds = 5 seconds
            player_grav -= 30 # Mega jump
            last_mega_jump_time = pygame.time.get_ticks() # Reset the timer
```

This way, the mega jump can only be used again after 5 seconds from the last usage.

Remember, it's best to implement game constants (like cooldown time) as named variables at the top of your file, so they're easily altered without having to dig through your code:

```python
MEGA_JUMP_COOLDOWN = 5000 # milliseconds
```
