Develop a method in Java that calculates the fuel efficiency of a Car object. Expanding upon this, implement additional methods that will factor in varying conditions like external temperatures, traffic conditions, and types of roads (highway, city, off-road). Also, make sure that your code accounts for different types of fuel (diesel, petrol, electricity) and the differences in efficiency that come along with them.
