To make it look surrounded by magical runes, you could potentially create a border or circle formation of symbolic, runic characters around it. 

Remember, SVG doesn't include any direct way to apply a specific "style" to an image, since it isn't a raster-based image format. The style-related attributes in SVG (such as fill, stroke, etc.) apply to the shapes and paths within the SVG, rather than an overall style.

