lso shed light on the potential impacts of quantum entanglement on the comprehensive realm of quantum mechanics, and how it might shape the future trajectory of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement? Could you also assess the potential repercussions of quantum entanglement on the extensive spectrum of quantum mechanics, and how it might influence the future of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement?
