This problem involves designing a CSS style sheet which entails practical hands-on coding, which is impossible to fully demonstrate on this platform. However, I will provide an example of how you can approach and structure your CSS style sheet. How you implement the design is up to your creativity and experimentation.

```css
/* CSS Reset */
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
  color: #444;
}

.container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 15px;
}

/* Banner */
.banner {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 600px;
  background-size: cover;
  background-position: center;
}

.banner h1 {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  font-size: 42px;
  text-align: center;
  color: #fff;
}

/* Navigation */
.navigation {
  margin: 20px 0;
  text-align: center;
}

.navigation ul {
  list-style: none;
}

.navigation li {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 0 10px;
}

.navigation a {
  text-decoration: none;
  color: #000;
}

/* Featured Products */
.featured-products {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-bottom: 50px;
}

.product {
  flex: 1 0 21%;  /* Responsive design principle, allows the element to grow and shrink */
  margin: 15px;
  padding: 20px;
  background-color: #f9f9f9;
  text-align: center;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.product img {
  width: 100%;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.product h2, .product p {
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}

/* Testimonials */
.testimonials {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 50px 0;
  background-color: #eee;
}

.testimonial {
  margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.testimonial p {
  font-size: 18px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* Enquiry Form */
.enquiry-form {
  width: 50%;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 30px;
  background-color: #f9f9f9;
  box-shadow: 0px 2px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
}

.enquiry-form input, .enquiry-form textarea {
  width: 100%;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  padding: 10px;
}

.enquiry-form button {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border: none;
  background-color: #000;
  color: #fff;
  cursor: pointer;
}
```
The design principles incorporated above include:

- Consistency in design elements: The padding, margin, font-size and colors are constantly reused.
- Emphasis on important elements: The banner header text is larger and centered to grab attention.
- Balance: There is symmetric balance in the .product and .enquiry-form design with padding and margin.
- Contrast: Font color and the background colors for different sections provide good contrast.
- Responsiveness: By using flexbox, the layout of the website changes to accommodate different screen sizes.
