hy and quantum entanglement? Could you also illuminate the potential influences of quantum entanglement on the expansive universe of quantum mechanics, and how it might shape the future trajectory of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement? Could you also assess the potential impacts of quantum entanglement on the vast expanse of quantum mechanics, and how it might plot the future path of quantum cryptography and quantum entanglement?
