Can you generate a Java program that sorts a given array?
[6, 5, 4, 2, 1]
<|end|>
<|asst|>
Sure, here's a simple Java program using Bubble Sort method to sort an array:

```java
public class Main {
  public static void main(String []args) {
    int[] array = {6, 5, 4, 2, 1};
    bubbleSort(array);
    System.out.print("Sorted Array: ");
    for(int i = 0; i < array.length; i++) {
      System.out.print(array[i] + " ");
    }
  }

  static void bubbleSort(int[] array) {
    int n = array.length;  
    int temp = 0;  
    for(int i = 0; i < n; i++){  
      for(int j = 1; j < (n-i); j++){  
        if(array[j-1] > array[j]){  
          temp = array[j-1];  
          array[j-1] = array[j];  
          array[j] = temp;  
        }  
      }  
    }
  }
}
```
This program will output: Sorted Array: 1 2 4 5 6.
<|end|>


