Sure! Here's a simple program using HTML and JavaScript to create a button that increments a counter and updates the button's label at each click:

HTML:

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<body>
  <button id='myButton' onClick="incrementCounter()">0</button>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
```

JavaScript (in "script.js"):

